+  {
+   "cell_type": "markdown",
+   "metadata": {},
+   "source": [
+    "Afterwards, you can use this DataFrame to map each domain ID to the corresponding domain label:\n"
+   ]
+  },
+  {
+   "cell_type": "code",
+   "execution_count": 8,
+   "metadata": {},
+   "outputs": [],
+   "source": [
+    "adata.obs[\"novae_domains_labeled\"] = adata.obs[\"novae_domains_res1\"].map(df_labels[\"label\"])"
+   ]
+  },
+  {
+   "cell_type": "markdown",
+   "metadata": {},
+   "source": [
+    "And plot the results:\n"
